{"header":{"form":"sanctuaire","pos":"adjectif","full_form":"sanctuaire","full_pos":"adjectif","description":"Saint","others":[{"form":"sanctuaire","pos":"nom","label":"sanctuaire, nom masculin"}]},"content":[{"id":"dmf","content":["<principal id='DMF_57961'><div class='s-header'><h2 class='s-entry'>SANCTUAIRE</h2><span class='s-pos'>adjectif</span></div><div class='s-dmf-links'>[GD : <a href='http://micmap.org/dicfro/search/dictionnaire-godefroy/saintuaire_3'><span class='t-i'>saintuaire3</span></a> ; *FEW (XI, 150b) : <a href='https://lecteur-few.atilf.fr/lire/110/150'><span class='t-i'>sanctus</span></a>]</div><definition><span class='s-definition'>Saint</span>. </definition><span class='s-example-inline'><span class='t-i'>Singnour, quant S. Hubiert par divins exemplaire Fist la citeit de Liege, li ystoire l'exclaire Par dessus, ilh le fist si com fut necessaire&nbsp;; Mie n'avoit grant puple l'evesque <span class='t-g'>santuaire</span></span> (JEAN D'OUTREM., Geste Liège B.B., t.4, a.1400, 602). </span><span class='s-example-inline'><span class='t-i'>Les esglises et monasteres furent derompus et abbatus, les <span class='t-g'>sanctuaires</span> custodes du corps Nostre Seigneur Jesus Christ, reliques, reliquaires, calices, croix, vestements, adornemens et paremens (...) ravis, prins, traittiéz sans reverance</span> (<span class='s-author'>Maupoint</span>, <cite>Journ. paris.</cite> F., p.1466, 103). </span></principal>"]},{"id":"history","content":{"presse":[{"year":1800,"freq":4.15},{"year":1810,"freq":5.96},{"year":1820,"freq":6.77},{"year":1830,"freq":7.79},{"year":1840,"freq":7.69},{"year":1850,"freq":6.18},{"year":1860,"freq":7.88},{"year":1870,"freq":4.12},{"year":1880,"freq":5.05},{"year":1890,"freq":4.99},{"year":1900,"freq":4.95},{"year":1910,"freq":3.96},{"year":1920,"freq":3.25},{"year":1930,"freq":3.63},{"year":1940,"freq":3.9},{"year":1950,"freq":3.51}],"lemonde":[{"year":1950,"freq":3.38},{"year":1960,"freq":3.28},{"year":1970,"freq":5.86},{"year":